          "text": "Primary: Necrotising soft-tissue infection of the left thigh with septic shock.\n\nSecondary:\n- ARDS (proned x2)\n- Acute kidney injury (requiring CVVH)\n- ICU-acquired weakness\n- Line sepsis day 14\n- New atrial fibrillation (rate-controlled)",
